      "value": "This is a definite must for me.\nIt used to be a mod, and made taking photos waaaay less clumsy, and a one-handed job.\nWithout this feature, it's nearly impossible to click the buttons when the camera is floating, since it wants to pick it up instead of clicking these buttons.",
